003	LEV	006	001	Eka Jehova Nyasaye nowacho ne Musa niya,
003	LEV	006	002	“Ka ngʼato otimo richo kendo ok obedo ja-ratiro e nyim Jehova Nyasaye ka owuondo nyawadgi kuom gima osingne kata gima owene mondo oriti kata gima okwal,
