003	LEV	007	038	Chikegi Jehova Nyasaye nomiyo Musa e Got Sinai, chiengʼ mane ochoko jo-Israel mondo ochiwne Jehova Nyasaye misengini mag-gi, ka gin e Thim mar Sinai.
