003	LEV	015	025	“‘Ka dhako chwer ndalo mogwarore e kinde ma ok one malo, kata ka ochwer mokadho ndalo ma ojanene malo, to enobed mogak kuom ndalo duto ma pod ochwerieno mana machalre kaka ndalone monenoe malo.
003	LEV	015	026	Kitanda moro amora moninde e ndalo ma pod oneno malo nobed mogak mana kaka kitanda monindoe mapile kendo gimoro amora mobetie nobed mogak mana machal gi kinde monenoe malo.
