013	1CH	002	045	Wuod Shamai ne en Maon, to Maon ne wuon Beth Zur.
013	1CH	002	046	Chi Kaleb machielo ma nyinge Efa ne min Haran, Moza kod Gazez. Haran ne wuon Gazez.
013	1CH	002	047	Yawuot Jadai ne gin: Ragem, Jotham, Geshan, Pelet, Efa kod Shaf.
013	1CH	002	048	Chi Kaleb machielo ma nyinge Maaka ne min Sheba kod Tirhana.
013	1CH	002	049	En bende nonywolo Shaf mane wuon Madmana to Sheva nonywolo Makbena kod Gibea. Nyar Kaleb niluongo ni Aksa.
013	1CH	002	050	Jogo duto ema ne nyikwa Kaleb. Yawuot Hur wuod Efratha makayo ne gin: Shobal wuon Kiriath Jearim,
013	1CH	002	051	Salma wuon Bethlehem kod Haref wuon Beth Gader.
013	1CH	002	052	Nyikwa Shobal wuon Kiriath Jearim ne gin, Haroe mane nus jo-Manahath,
013	1CH	002	053	to anywola Kiriath Jearim ne gin: jo-Ithri, jo-Puthi, jo-Shumath kod Mishrai. Kuomgi ema ne jo-Zorath gi jo-Eshtaol owuokie.
013	1CH	002	054	Nyikwa Salma ne gin: jo-Bethlehem, jo-Netofath; Atroth Beth Joab, nus jo-Manahath, jo-Zor,
