013	1CH	003	024	Yawuot Elioenai ne gin: Hodavia, Eliashib, Pelaya, Akub, Johanan, Delaya kod Anani, giduto gin yawuowi abiriyo.
013	1CH	004	001	Nyikwa Juda ne gin: Perez, Hezron, Karmi, Hur gi Shobal.
013	1CH	004	002	Reaya wuod Shobal nonywolo Jahath, to Jahath nonywolo Ahumai kod Lahad. Magi ema ne anywola mar jo-Zorath.
013	1CH	004	003	Magi ema ne yawuot Etam: Jezreel, Ishma kod Idbash, to nyamin-gi niluongo ni Hazelelponi.
013	1CH	004	004	Penuel nonywolo Gedor kod Ezer ma wuon Husha. Magi ne nyikwa Hur, mane en wuod Efratha makayo mane wuon Bethlehem.
013	1CH	004	005	Ashur wuon Tekoa ne nigi mon ariyo, Hela kod Naara.
013	1CH	004	006	Naara nonywolone Ahuzam, Hefer, Temeni kod Hahashtari. Magi ema ne nyikwa Naara.
013	1CH	004	007	Yawuot Hela ne gin: Zereth, Zohar, Ethnan
013	1CH	004	008	kod Koz, mane wuon Anub, to gi Hazobeba kod anywola mar Aharhel wuod Harum.
013	1CH	004	009	Jabez ne ngʼat marahuma moloyo owetene. Min-gi nochake Jabez, kowacho niya, “Ne anywole gi rem.”
013	1CH	004	010	Jabez noywagorene Nyasach Israel, “Yaye, yie igwedha mondo pinyruodha omedre! Mad lweti obed koda kendo orita mondo kik gima rach ohinya kendo abedi maonge rem.” To Nyasaye notimone mana kaka ne okwayono.
013	1CH	004	011	Kelub, owadgi Shuha nonywolo Mehir mane wuon Eshton.
013	1CH	004	012	Eshton nonywolo Beth Rafa, Pasea kod Tehina mane wuon Ir Nahash. Magi ne jo-Reka.
