013	1CH	006	048	Jo-Lawi mamoko to ne omi tije mamoko duto e hema, e od Nyasaye.
013	1CH	006	049	To Harun gi joge ema ne chiwo misango e kendo mar misango miwangʼo pep, kendo ne giwangʼo ubani e kendo mar ubani, kendo negitimo misango mipwodhogo richo jo-Israel. Negitiyo tije duto mag Kama Ler Moloyo, kaka Musa jatich Nyasaye nochiko.
013	1CH	006	050	Magi e joka Harun: Harun nonywolo Eliazar, Eliazar nonywolo Finehas, Finehas nonywolo Abishua,
013	1CH	006	051	Abishua nonywolo Buki, Buki nonywolo Uzi, Uzi nonywolo Zerahia,
013	1CH	006	052	Zerahia nonywolo Merayoth, Merayoth nonywolo Amaria, Amaria nonywolo Ahitub,
013	1CH	006	053	Ahitub nonywolo Zadok, to Zadok nonywolo Ahimaz.
013	1CH	006	054	Magi e kuondegi mane gidakie kod gwenge mane omigi (tiende ni, mane omi joka Harun mane jo-dhood Kohath nikech pok mokwongo ne margi).
013	1CH	006	055	Ne omigi Hebron ei Juda kaachiel gi kuonde kwath molwore.
