013	1CH	006	060	Kuom oganda mag Benjamin to ne omi Gibeon, Geba, Alemeth kod Anathoth, kaachiel gi kuondegi mag kwath. Mier mane opog ne anywola Kohath ne gin apar gadek koriwore.
013	1CH	006	061	Joka Kohath mamoko to nopog mier apar koa e nus dhout oganda Manase.
