013	1CH	008	013	to gi Beria kod Shema mane jotend anywola mar jogo mane odak Aijalon kod jogo mane oriembo joma nodak Gath.
013	1CH	008	014	Ahio, Shashak, Jeremoth,
013	1CH	008	015	Zebadia, Arad, Eder,
