017	EST	005	006	Kane onwangʼo gimadho divai, ruoth nochako openjo Esta niya, “Koro angʼo midwaro kwayo? Ibiro miyigo. En angʼo mikwayo? Kata obed nus mar pinya to oyieni mondo ikawe.”
017	EST	005	007	Eka Esta nodwoko niya, Kwayona gi dwarona ema:
