# BOOK	018	JOB	Job	Ayub
018	JOB	001	001	Ne nitie ngʼat moro mane odak e piny Uz mane nyinge Ayub. Ngʼatni ne en ngʼama longʼo chuth kendo ngʼama kare; ne oluoro Nyasaye kendo nokwedo gik maricho.
018	JOB	001	002	Ne en gi yawuowi abiriyo gi nyiri adek
018	JOB	001	003	kendo ne en gi rombe alufu abiriyo, ngamia alufu adek, rweth pur mia abich, gi punde mia abich, kendo ne en gi jotich mangʼeny. Kuom mano, ne en ngʼat marahuma moloyo ji duto modak yo wuok chiengʼ.
018	JOB	001	004	Yawuote ne loso nyasi e utegi, ka moro ka moro kuomgi ni godiechienge kendo ne luongo nyiminegi adek mondo ochiem kendo ometh kodgi e nyasigigo.
018	JOB	001	005	Kane kinde mane gitimoe nyasigo oserumo, Ayub ne luongogi mondo opwodhgi. Okinyi kogwen notimo misango miwangʼo pep ne moro ka moro kuomgi, koparo ni dipo ka achiel kuomgi osetimo richo mi giyanyo Nyasaye gie chunygi. Ma ne en tim Ayub mane otimo kinde ka kinde.
018	JOB	001	006	Chiengʼ moro achiel malaike nobiro e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, kendo Satan bende nobiro kodgi.
018	JOB	001	007	Jehova Nyasaye nopenjo Satan niya, “Ia kanye?” Satan nodwoko Jehova Nyasaye niya, “Asebedo ka abayo abaya e piny, kendo alworora koni gi koni.”
018	JOB	001	008	Eka Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Satan niya, “Dipo ka iseparo wach moro kuom jatichna Ayub? Onge ngʼato machielo e piny ngima machalo kode nikech olongʼo kendo ngʼama kare en ngʼat moluora kendo motangʼ ne richo.”
018	JOB	001	009	Satan nodwoko niya, “Iparo ni Ayub oluoro Nyasaye kaonge gima omiyo?
018	JOB	001	010	Donge iseketo chiel molwore en kaachiel gi ode kod gik moko duto ma en-go? Donge isegwedho tich lwete, momiyo jambe gi kwethne olak e pinyno duto?
018	JOB	001	011	Tem ane ikaw gik moko duto ma en-go ka ok dokwongʼi e wangʼi?”
018	JOB	001	012	Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Satan niya, “Kare ber, gimoro amora ma en-go ni e lweti, to en owuon kik imule kata gi lith lweti.” Eka Satan nowuok oa e nyim Jehova Nyasaye.
018	JOB	001	013	Chiengʼ moro ka nyithind Ayub ne chiemo kendo metho e od owadgi maduongʼ,
018	JOB	001	014	achiel kuom jotij Ayub nobiro ire mowachone niya, “Noyudo ka wapuro gi rwedhi kendo punde ne kwayo machiegni kodwa,
018	JOB	001	015	to jo-Sabea nobiro momonjowa kendo okawogi duto. Bende gisenego jotiji duto gi ligangla ma an kendo ema atony mondo anyisi wachni!”
018	JOB	001	016	Kane oyudo pod owuoyo, jatich machielo nobiro mowacho niya, “Maj Nyasaye nolwar koa e polo mowangʼo rombe kaachiel gi jotich, kendo an kenda ema asetony mondo anyisi wachni!”
018	JOB	001	017	Kane pod owuoyo, jatich machielo nobiro mowacho niya, “Jo-Kaldea noloso migepe adek mag jolweny mi gimonjowa ma gikawo ngamia-gi duto kendo gidhigo. Gisenego jotichni duto gi ligangla, kendo an kenda ema asetony mondo anyisi wachni!”
018	JOB	001	018	Kane pod owuoyo, jatich machielo bende nobiro mowacho niya, “Yawuoti gi nyigi ne jochiemo kendo metho e od owadgi maduongʼ,
018	JOB	001	019	eka apoya nono yamo maduongʼ nomwomore koa e piny motimo ongoro kendo nogoyo konde angʼwen mag ot. Odno norwombore kendo giduto gisetho ma an kenda ema asetony mondo anyisi wachni!”
018	JOB	001	020	E sa onogo, Ayub noa malo mi oyiecho lepe kendo olielo yie wiye. Eka nopodho piny auma kolemo,
018	JOB	001	021	kowacho niya: “Ne aa ei minwa ka an duk, kendo abiro dok ka an aduk. Jehova Nyasaye ema nochiwo kendo Jehova Nyasaye ema osekawo; mad nying Jehova Nyasaye opaki.”
018	JOB	001	022	Kuom magi duto, Ayub ne ok otimo richo kata kwano Nyasaye kaka jaketho.
018	JOB	002	001	Odiechiengʼ machielo, malaike nochako obiro mondo gichungʼ e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, kendo Satan bende nobiro kodgi.
018	JOB	002	002	To Jehova Nyasaye nopenjo Satan niya, “Ia kanye?” Satan nodwoko Jehova Nyasaye niya, “Asebedo ka abayo abaya e piny, kendo alworora koni gi koni.”
018	JOB	002	003	Eka Jehova Nyasaye nopenjo Satan niya, “Dipo ka iseparo wach moro kuom jatichna Ayub? Onge ngʼat machielo e piny ngima machalo kode nikech olongʼo chuth kendo en ngʼama kare moluora kendo motangʼ ne richo.” Pod osiko mana gi berne mapile, kata obedo ni ne idonjone ira mondo atieke kaonge gimomiyo.
018	JOB	002	004	Satan nodwoko niya, “Dhano nyalo yie weyo gimoro amora ma en-go mana ni mondo obed mangima.
018	JOB	002	005	Koro temie kimulo dende gi chokene ka ok dokwongʼi e wangʼi.”
018	JOB	002	006	Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Satan niya, “Mano ber, koro en e lweti; makmana ni ngimane ema kik imul.”
018	JOB	002	007	Kuom mano Satan nowuok oa e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, kendo nogoyo Ayub gi buche maremo malit, kochakore e tiende nyaka e wiye.
018	JOB	002	008	Eka Ayub nokawo balatago, mondo ogwonyrego kobet e buru.
018	JOB	002	009	Chiege nokone niya, “Pod kitini itwerigo atweya kuom Nyasachini? Angʼo mamoni kwongʼo Nyasaye mondo itho!”
018	JOB	002	010	To nodwoke niya, “Iwuoyo ka dhako mofuwo. Diwayie mana gi ber kende ma aa kuom Nyasaye to ok chandruok?” Kuom magi duto, Ayub ne ok otimo richo e gimoro amora mane owacho.
018	JOB	002	011	Ka osiepe Ayub adek mane gin Elifaz ja-Teman gi Bildad ja-Shua kod Zofar Ja-Namath nowinjo chandruok duto mane en-go, ne giwuok ka gia e miechgi kendo ne giwinjore mondo girom kaachiel mondo gidhi gitimne mos kendo gihoye.
018	JOB	002	012	Kane ginene ka pod gin mabor, ne ok ginyal ngʼeye. Negichako ywak matek, kendo ne giyiecho lepgi mi gibukore gi buru.
018	JOB	002	013	Bangʼe negibet kode piny e lowo kuom ndalo abiriyo odiechiengʼ gotieno. Onge ngʼama nowachone wach moro amora, nikech negineno ka chandruok mane en-go ne pek moloyo.
018	JOB	003	001	Bangʼ mano, Ayub nowuoyo ka kwongʼo chiengʼ mane onywole.
018	JOB	003	002	Ayub nowacho kama:
018	JOB	003	003	“Mad chiengʼ mane onywolaeni lal nono, kaachiel gi otieno mane owachie ni, ‘Onywol nyathi ma wuowi!’
018	JOB	003	004	Odiechiengno mad lokre mudho; mad Nyasaye man malo kik dewe; mad ler moro amora kik rieny kuome.
018	JOB	003	005	Mad odiechiengno otim luoch kendo mudho mandiwa oime; boche polo mondo oume; kendo wangʼ chiengʼ otim mudho.
018	JOB	003	006	Otienono, mad olal e mudho mandiwa; kik obed kaka achiel kuom odiechienge mag higa, kendo kik kwane kaka achiel kuom odiechienge mag dwe.
018	JOB	003	007	Mad otienono bed migumba; mad kik winj koko moro amora mar mor e iye.
018	JOB	003	008	Mad joma kwongʼo odiechienge okwongʼ odiechiengno, ma gin jogo molony gi luongo le manie nam miluongo ni Leviathan mawuogi.
018	JOB	003	009	Mad sulwege mokinyi lokre mudho; mad piny mogeno ni biro ru tamre, kendo kik one ka ugwe chako wangʼ,
018	JOB	003	010	nikech ne ok oloro dhoudi mag ii minwa mondo ne kik nywola kendo ane chandruok makoro anenogi.
018	JOB	003	011	“Dine atho ei minwa, kata dine obwoga ka inywola?
018	JOB	003	012	Angʼo momiyo minwa nopira e chonge kendo adhodho thunde?
018	JOB	003	013	Nimar dikoro ayweyo gi kwe; kendo dikoro anindo kendo ayweyo,
018	JOB	003	014	gi ruodhi kaachiel gi jongʼad rieko mag piny, mane ogero kuondegi madongo mag dak matinde olokore gundni,
018	JOB	003	015	kaachiel gi joloch mane nigi dhahabu, kendo mane opongʼo utegi gi fedha.
018	JOB	003	016	Koso angʼo mane omono panda ei liel ka nyathi monywol kosetho, kata ka nyathi mayom mane ok oneno ler mar odiechiengʼ?
018	JOB	003	017	Kuno joma timbegi richo weyoe timbegigo, kendo kuno joma ool yudoe yweyo.
018	JOB	003	018	Joma ni e twech kuno bende winjo maber; nikech gionge gi nyapara ma chikogi kuno.
018	JOB	003	019	Jomatindo gi jomadongo ni kuno kata wasumbini bende bedo maonge e bwo chik.
018	JOB	003	020	“Angʼo momiyo ichiwo ngima ne joma winjo malit, kod ngima ne joma chunygi lit,
018	JOB	003	021	gigombo tho, to tho ok neg-gi, adier, gidwaro tho moloyo mwandu mopandi,
018	JOB	003	022	gin joma opongʼ gi mor kendo gibedo moil ka gitundo ei liel?
018	JOB	003	023	Angʼo momiyo owe ngʼato ka ngima to yorene odinore, ka ngʼatno Nyasaye ogengʼone koni gi koni?
018	JOB	003	024	Nikech kuyo kod ywak omona chiemo; kendo chur ma achurgo chalo gi oula mabubni.
018	JOB	003	025	Gima ne aluoro ema koro osemaka; gima ne aluoro mogik e ngimana ema koro osetimorena.
018	JOB	003	026	Aonge gi kwe, chunya chandore; aonge yweyo, kendo thagruok lilo ema aneno.”
018	JOB	004	001	Eka Elifaz ja-Teman nodwoke kama:
018	JOB	004	002	“Bende chunyi nyalo doko malit ka ngʼato okeloni wach moro nimar ok anyal lingʼ mak awuoyo?
018	JOB	004	003	Parie kaka isepuonjo ji mangʼeny, kendo isejiwo joma chunygi onyosore.
018	JOB	004	004	Wechegi osekonyo joma opodho; kendo isejiwo joma tekogi orumo.
018	JOB	004	005	To koro chandruok osechoponi kendo chunyi onyosore omiyo ionge gi kwe.
018	JOB	004	006	Luor miluorogo Nyasaye dak koro miyi chir koso ngimani moriere dak koro miyi geno?
018	JOB	004	007	“Koro par ane: En ngʼa mosekum maonge ketho? Koso joma kare mage minyalo tieki?
018	JOB	004	008	Gima aseneno en ni joma chwoyo richo gi chandruok kayo mana richo.
018	JOB	004	009	Itiekogi apoya nono gi much Nyasaye; kendo sa ma mirimbe obiro to gilal nono.
018	JOB	004	010	Sibuoche nyalo ruto kendo sibuoche mager nyalo goyo asumbi, to kata kamano leke sibuoche maroteke osemuki.
018	JOB	004	011	Sibuor koro tho nikech gima ocham onge, kendo nyithi sibuor oringo ma oke.
018	JOB	004	012	“Ne okuodhna wach moro mos, to ne awinje mana marach rach.
018	JOB	004	013	Wachni nobirona gotieno e yor lek, e sa ma nindo goye ji ngoga,
018	JOB	004	014	kendo luoro gi kibaji nogoya momiyo denda duto onyosore.
018	JOB	004	015	Eka muya nokudho wangʼa, mi yier denda duto nojuol.
018	JOB	004	016	Nochungʼ molingʼ thi, to ne ok anyal ngʼeyo ni en angʼo. Kido moro nobiro mochungʼ e nyim wangʼa, kendo nawinjo dwol moro machil, kawacho niya:
018	JOB	004	017	‘Bende dhano mangima nyalo bedo makare moloyo Nyasaye? Dhano bende dibed maler moloyo jachwechne?
018	JOB	004	018	Ka Nyasaye ok nyal geno jotichne, ma kata malaika bende joketho e nyime,
018	JOB	004	019	to koro ere kaka dodew dhano molos gi lowo, ma mise mag-gi en mana buru, ma inyalo duny marum mana ka oguyo!
018	JOB	004	020	Chakre kogwen nyaka odhiambo inyalo turgi matindo tindo ka ok ongʼeyo, kendo gilal nyaka chiengʼ.
018	JOB	004	021	Donge tondegi ma gitweyogo hema igonyo, mondo omi githo ka gionge rieko?’
018	JOB	005	001	“In Ayub, luong ane ka bende nitiere ngʼama nyalo dwoki? Bende nitie kuom jo-malaika minyalo ringo irgi?
018	JOB	005	002	Ich wangʼ nego ngʼama ofuwo, kendo nyiego tieko ngʼama omingʼ.
018	JOB	005	003	An awuon aseneno ngʼama ofuwo ka odak e ngima maber, to apoya nono opo ka ode okwongʼ.
018	JOB	005	004	Nyithinde ok nyal yudo konyruok kendo onge ngʼama chwakgi e od bura.
018	JOB	005	005	Joma kech oloyo chamo chamb ngʼat mofuwono, nyaka mago madongo e kind kuthe, kendo joma riyo oloyo dwaro yako mwandune.
018	JOB	005	006	Nikech richo ok honre ahona kayiem, kata chandruok bende ok bi kaonge gima omiyo.
018	JOB	005	007	To dhano inywolo ei chandruok, mana kaka pilni mach dhwolore kadhi malo.
018	JOB	005	008	“Dine bed ni an in, to dine atero ywakna ne Nyasaye; kendo keto weche mathaga e nyime.
