018	JOB	005	010	Omiyo koth chue e piny; kendo omiyo puothe bedo mangʼich.
018	JOB	005	011	Joma ni piny otingʼo malo, kendo ohoyo joma ywak.
018	JOB	005	012	Oketho chenro mar joma paro timo timbe mamono mondo omi gik ma giparogo kik timre.
018	JOB	005	013	Omako joma riek gi riekogi giwegi, kendo gimoro amora ma giparo timo ok timre.
018	JOB	005	014	Piny othonegi mudho kata mana ka chiengʼ rieny, gibagni odiechiengʼ tir mana ka gima en otieno.
018	JOB	005	015	Oreso joma odhier e dho tho; kendo oresogi e lwet joma roteke.
018	JOB	005	016	Omiyo joma odhier bedo gi geno, to joma timbegi mono omiyo lingʼ thi.
018	JOB	005	017	“En jahawi ngʼat ma Nyasaye kwero, omiyo kik icha kum mar Jehova Nyasaye Maratego.
018	JOB	005	018	Nimar kokecho kodi mochwadi to en bende ema ochako othiedho kuonde mohinyorego.
018	JOB	005	019	Enoresi ka in e masiche mar auchiel; to adier, ok enoweyi ichopi e masiche mar abiriyo.
018	JOB	005	020	Ka dera omako piny, to obiro resi e tho, kendo ka lweny gore to obiro resi e dho ligangla.
018	JOB	005	021	Enopandi kuom dhok makwongʼi, kendo ok niluor kethruok mabiro.
018	JOB	005	022	Inibed mamor ka masira gi kech nitie kendo ok niluor le mager mag piny.
018	JOB	005	023	Nikech initim winjruok gi kite manie lowo, kendo le mag bungu nobed kodi gi kwe.
018	JOB	005	024	Iningʼe ni hembi oriti maber; inikwan mwanduni achiel achiel, kendo ok niyud kaonge moro kuomgi molal.
018	JOB	005	025	Inibed kingʼeyo ni nyithindi nobed mangʼeny, kendo nyikwayi nochal gi lum manie piny.
018	JOB	005	026	Inidag amingʼa mitho kapod itegno, mana ka cham mokaa e kinde mowinjore.
018	JOB	005	027	“Wasenono wachni, mwanwangʼo ni en adier. Omiyo winje kendo iti kode e ngimani.”
018	JOB	006	001	Eka Ayub nodwoke kama:
018	JOB	006	002	“Ka dine bed ni inyalo pimo chandruok ma an-go, kata pimo masira duto momaka e ratil,
018	JOB	006	003	to adier, dine gibedo mapek moloyo kwoyo mathoth manie dho nam, mano emomiyo wechena osebedo ka yombore.
018	JOB	006	004	Aserni mag Jehova Nyasaye Maratego osechwoyo denda, ringra opongʼ gi kwiri marach ma asernigo okelo; kendo masiche mag Nyasaye olwora koni gi koni.
018	JOB	006	005	Donge punda nyalo mana ywak ka oonge lum mocham, kata rwath nyalo ywak kaonge chiemo?
018	JOB	006	006	Chiemo maboth bende inyalo cham ka ok oketie chumbi, koso mit mane miyudo ei nyai tongʼ marachar?
018	JOB	006	007	Ok ahero chiemo ma kamago; nimar chiemo ma kamago miya tuo.
018	JOB	006	008	“Kuom mano, mad ayud gima akwayo, mad Nyasaye chiwna gima ageno yudo,
018	JOB	006	009	kendo oyie otoya matindo tindo mi onega chuth.
018	JOB	006	010	Kotimona kamano eka chunya noyud hoch, anabed gi kwe, kata obedo ni an gi rem malit; nikech ok asedagi weche mag Ngʼama Ler.
018	JOB	006	011	“Teko mane ma an-go ma dimi pod abed gi geno? Ber mane ma pod ni e nyima madimi abed mos?
018	JOB	006	012	An gi teko machal gi teko kidi koso? Bende ringra olos gi nyinyo?
018	JOB	006	013	Bende an gi teko mar konyora kenda ka koro giga duto osegol kuoma?
018	JOB	006	014	“E kinde ma ngʼato nigi chandruok kama, to osiepne onego okeche, kata obedo ni oseweyo luoro Jehova Nyasaye Maratego.
018	JOB	006	015	Owetena to oselokore joma ok nyal gen, mana ka aore matindo ma pigegi ok siki kata ka oula mogingore ndalo koth,
018	JOB	006	016	to pe manie wi gode lokore oula kendo mogingore gi pi mamol,
018	JOB	006	017	e kinde oro to gichungʼ ma ok ringi, kendo lal nono e yoregi kinde ma piny liet.
018	JOB	006	018	Jowuoth baro weyo yoregi ma giluwo; gidhi nyaka piny motwo mi githo kuno.
018	JOB	006	019	Jowuoth moa Tema gi johala moa Sheba manyo aore mondo oyudie pi.
018	JOB	006	020	Gibiro ka gin gi geno mar yudo pi, to ka gichopo kanyo to giyudo ni pi ma gineno onge, mi chunygi nyosre.
018	JOB	006	021	Koro in bende iselokori ngʼama ok nyal konyo; kineno gimoro mabwogo ji to luoro maki.
018	JOB	006	022	Bende asekwayoue mondo umiyae kony moro mugolo kuom mwandu mondo akonyrago,
