018	JOB	006	029	Lokri, iwe timo ne ji marach; par maber kendo, nikech an ngʼat makare.
018	JOB	006	030	Bende nitie gimoro amora marach ma lewa osewacho? Donge an gi rieko mar ngʼeyo gima ok owinjore?
018	JOB	007	001	“Donge dhano nigi tich matek e piny? Donge ndalone chalo gi ndalo mag ngʼat mondiki kuom kinde machwok?
018	JOB	007	002	Mana kaka misumba ma gombo ni seche mag odhiambo ochop piyo, kata ka ngʼama ondiki marito chudo mare gi geno,
