018	JOB	007	008	Wenge makoro nena sani ok nochak onena kendo, gibiro dwara to ok gininena.
018	JOB	007	009	Mana kaka bor polo rumo mi lal nono, e kaka ngʼat miyiko e liel ok duogi.
