021	ECC	010	001	Mana kaka lwangʼni motho miyo gima dungʼ mangʼwe ngʼar bedo gi tik marach, e kaka miriambo matin ketho rieko kod luor.
021	ECC	010	002	Ngʼat mariek timo timbe mabeyo, to ngʼat mofuwo timo timbe maricho.
021	ECC	010	003	Fupe nenore anena kata kowuotho e yo, kendo ji duto manene ongʼeyo ni ofuwo.
021	ECC	010	004	Ka ruoth okecho kodi, to kik iwe tiji mitiyono; nimar kibolori to ruoth nyalo ngʼwononi kuom kethogi mangʼeny.
021	ECC	010	005	Nitie richo ma aseneno e bwo wangʼ chiengʼ, ketho moro mawuok kuom jatelo:
021	ECC	010	006	Joma ofuwo imiyo tije madongo dongo, to jo-mwandu to iketo e mago matindo.
021	ECC	010	007	Aseneno wasumbini e ngʼe farese, to jotelo wuotho gi tiendgi ka wasumbini.
021	ECC	010	008	Ngʼama kunyo bur matut nyalo lwar e iye; to ngʼama muko kor ot thuol nyalo kayo.
021	ECC	010	009	Ngʼama kunyo kite inyalo hiny gi kitego; to ngʼama baro yien inyalo hiny gi yien.
021	ECC	010	010	Ka le dik kendo lewe ok opiagi, to nyaka oti kode gi teko mathoth eka obar yien, kuom mano chan gik moko chon kapod ok itimo.
