022	SOL	001	012	Kane ruoth chiemo e mesane, mo mangʼwe ngʼar man-gi tik mamit nopongʼo ot kadonjo.
022	SOL	001	013	Jaherana chalona gi mo mane-mane mobo matin ma nengone tek, mantie e kind thundena.
