#
# BOOK	023	ISA	Isaiah	Isaya
023	ISA	001	001	Fweny ma wuoyo ewi Juda kod Jerusalem mane Isaya wuod Amoz oneno e ndalo loch Uzia gi Jotham gi Ahaz kod Hezekia mane gin ruodhi Juda.
023	ISA	001	002	Winji yaye polo! Chik iti, yaye piny! Nikech Jehova Nyasaye osewuoyo: asepidho nyithindo mobedo madongo, to gisepiem koda.
023	ISA	001	003	Rwath ongʼeyo wuon, kendo kanyna ongʼeyo kund wuon, to jo-Israel ok ongʼeya adier; joga awuon onge gi winjo.
023	ISA	001	004	Yaye oganda ma joricho, koth ji mogangore gi timbe mamono, kanyakla mar joma timbegi richo, nyithindo mochiwore ne timbe acheje! Giseweyo Jehova Nyasaye; gisejaro Jal Maler mar Israel giselokone ngʼegi.
023	ISA	001	005	Angʼo momiyo pod usiko kudwaro kum? Angʼo momiyo usiko kungʼanyo? Wiyeu opongʼ gi adhonde kendo chunyu opongʼ gi lit.
023	ISA	001	006	Kochakore e tiendu nyaka ewiu onge kama ngima, kendo upongʼ gi adhonde, kuonde moriemo, kod kuonde moridhore mapok oketie yath, mapok otwe kata wiroe yath.
023	ISA	001	007	Pinyu odongʼ gunda, miechu madongo osewangʼ gi mach; puotheu jopinje mamoko osemau mana kuneno gi wangʼu, ma gidongʼ gundni mana ka joma wasigu oseriembo.
023	ISA	001	008	Nyar Sayun odongʼ ka kiru manie e puoth mzabibu, kata ka abila e puoth budho kendo ka dala maduongʼ ma wasigu omonjo.
023	ISA	001	009	Ka dine Jehova Nyasaye Maratego ok oweyo jomoko kuomwa otony, to dine wachalo gi jo-Sodom, adier dikoro ne wachalo kaka jo-Gomora.
023	ISA	001	010	Winjuru wach Jehova Nyasaye un jotelo mag Sodom, chikuru itu ne chike mag Nyasachwa un oganda man Gomora!
023	ISA	001	011	Jehova Nyasaye wacho kama: “Misengini mangʼeny mutimogi amon-go.” Aol gi misengini miwangʼo pep mag imbe kaachiel gi boche mag jamni machwe. Ok amor gi remb rwedhi gi mag imbe kod mag nywogi.
023	ISA	001	012	Ere ngʼama osekwayou gigo ka ubiro e nyima, donge mano en dwanyo hekalu mara maler.
023	ISA	001	013	Kik ukel misengini maonge tich e nyima! Tik ubanino dungʼna marach, kendo sewni mutimo ka dwe opor, gi mag Sabato kata e chokruoge duto ok amorgo.
023	ISA	001	014	Sewni mutimo ka dwe opor kod sewni moyier chido chunya, giselokore tingʼ mapek matura bende aol gi tingʼogi.
023	ISA	001	015	Ka utingʼo bedeu malo kulemo to anapandnu wangʼa, kendo kata ulem machal nade to ok anadwoku. Lweteu osechwero remo mangʼeny!
023	ISA	001	016	Lwokreuru mondo ubed maler. Goluru timbeu mamono e wangʼa!
023	ISA	001	017	Weuru timbeu maricho; to upuonjru timbe mabeyo! Dwaruru tim makare, kendo jiwuru joma ithiro. Bende nyaka une ni nyithind kiye kod mon ma chwogi otho oyal buchegi e yo makare kare.
023	ISA	001	018	Jehova Nyasaye wacho niya, “Biuru machiegni mondo wapor wach, kata obedo ni richou kwar manade to ibiro luoki magibed matar ka pe, bende kata bed ni gikwar malich to nobed marachar ka pamba.
023	ISA	001	019	Ka uyie kuoma muboloru kendo umako chikena duto, to unucham gik mabeyo mag piny;
023	ISA	001	020	to ka udagi kendo ungʼanyo to ligangla notieku.” Nimar an Jehova Nyasaye ema asewacho.
023	ISA	001	021	Neye kaka dala maduongʼ ma yande oluoro Nyasaye koro oselokore ochot! Kinde moko ne en kama adiera odakie, tim makare ne yudore, to tinde jonek ema opongʼe.
023	ISA	001	022	Fedha magu oselokore chuoth nyinyo bende divai magu mogen oseruw gi pi.
023	ISA	001	023	Jotendu ongʼanyo kendo gin e kanyakla mar jokwoge, giduto gihero asoya, kendo gihero gik makonyogi giwegi. Ok giyal buche nyithind kiye kare, bende weche mamon ma chwogi otho okelo e nyimgi ok gidew.
023	ISA	001	024	Kuom mano, Ruoth Nyasaye ma en Jehova Nyasaye Maratego, kendo Jehova Nyasaye mar kanyakla mar Israel wacho kama: “Anayud kwe kuom jok ma jara kendo nachul kuor ne wasika.
023	ISA	001	025	Anachwadu gi masiche kendo anapwodhu maler, mi agol timbeu mamono duto.
023	ISA	001	026	Bangʼe anaduognu jongʼad bura makare kaka ne timore e ndalo machon, kendo jongʼad rieko mane nitie aa chakruok. Eka noluongu ni Dala Maduongʼ mar Tim Makare, Dala Maduongʼ Madiera Nitie.”
023	ISA	001	027	Sayun nopwodh gi bura makare bende joma oyie modak e iye norit kod adiera.
023	ISA	001	028	To joma ongʼanyo kod joricho duto gi joma oweyo Jehova Nyasaye notiek chuth.
023	ISA	001	029	Wiu nokuodi gi tiend yiende mag ober ma umorgo kutimoe misengini, kendo unubed gi kuyo kuom puothe museyiero mondo ulemie.
023	ISA	001	030	Ubiro chalo kaka yiend ober ma ite ner kendo kaka puodho ma ok yud pi.
023	ISA	001	031	Ngʼat maratego e dieru nodok manyap, kendo tekone nowuog mana ka pilni, kendo gigo duto nowangʼ pep maonge ngʼama nyalo nego majno.
023	ISA	002	001	Ma e fweny mane Isaya wuod Amoz noneno kuom Juda kod Jerusalem:
023	ISA	002	002	E ndalo giko got mogerie hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye nobed gi teko e kind gode duto molwore, kendo ibiro tingʼe malo moyombo gode duto kendo ogendini duto nobi ma pongʼe.
023	ISA	002	003	Ogendini mangʼeny nobi kawacho niya, “Biuru wadhi e got mar Jehova Nyasaye, e od Nyasach Jakobo. Enopuonjwa wechene mondo wawuothie e yorene.” Chik nowuog Sayun, kendo wach Jehova Nyasaye nowuog koa Jerusalem.
023	ISA	002	004	Obiro ngʼado bura e kind ogendini kendo nokel kwe e kind ogendini mangʼeny. Ginithedh ligengligi olokre kwe mag pur kendo tongegi ginithedhi olokre pende keyo. Onge piny mano kedi gi nyawadgi gi ligangla bende ok ginichak gipuonjre ne lweny kendo.
023	ISA	002	005	Yaye od Jakobo, biuru mondo wawuoth e ler mar Jehova Nyasaye.
023	ISA	002	006	Yaye Jehova Nyasaye, isejwangʼo jogi, jogi ma nyikwa Jakobo. Gipongʼ gi timbe mag mudho kod timbe mag jwok moa yo wuok chiengʼ, gitimo timbe jwok ka jo-Filistia, kendo gin e winjruok gi joma ok oyie.
023	ISA	002	007	Pinygi opongʼ gi fedha kod dhahabu; kendo mwandugi okadho akwana. Pinygi opongʼ kod farese; ngechegi mag lweny okadho akwana.
023	ISA	002	008	Pinygi opongʼ kod nyiseche manono; gilamo gik ma gipayo kod lwetgi, gigo ma lwetgi ema oloso.
023	ISA	002	009	Omiyo dhano nodwok piny kendo ogendini mangʼeny noma teko, kuom mano ok nowenegi.
023	ISA	002	010	Donjuru e buche manie kind lwendni, ponduru e buche manie lowo ka luoro omakou nikech, duongʼ malich mar Jehova Nyasaye kod tekone!
023	ISA	002	011	Wangʼ teko mar ngʼama janjore nothir kendo sunga mag ji nodwok piny; Jehova Nyasaye kende ema notingʼ nyinge malo odiechiengno.
023	ISA	002	012	Jehova Nyasaye Maratego owalo odiechiengʼ manokumie josunga, joma kawore gi jogo matingʼore malo duto (mi nodwokgi piny),
023	ISA	002	013	nimar yiende sida duto maboyo moriere man Lebanon kendo yiende mag ober duto man Bashan,
023	ISA	002	014	kaachiel gi gode maboyo duto gi gode matindo duto motingʼore malo,
023	ISA	002	015	gi kuonde moger malo mag jorito, kendo gi ohinga mochiel motegno,
023	ISA	002	016	kod meli mangʼeny duto mag ohala gi yiedhi molos mabeyo.
023	ISA	002	017	Wich teko mar dhano ibiro dwoko piny kendo sunga mag ji nothir, mi Jehova Nyasaye kende ema notingʼ malo odiechiengno,
023	ISA	002	018	kendo nyiseche manono notiek pep.
023	ISA	002	019	Ji noring kapondo e buche manie kind lwendni to gi buche manie lowo, ka luoro omakogi nikech duongʼ malich mar Jehova Nyasaye, kod e kindeno mano thinyre mondo oyieng piny.
023	ISA	002	020	E kindeno ji nojwangʼ nyiseche manono molos gi fedha kod dhahabu ma yande gilamo, kaachiel gi oyieyo kod olik tiga.
023	ISA	002	021	Ji noring kapondo e buche manie kind lwendni kod buche manie kor lwanda, ka luoro omakogi nikech duongʼ malich mar Jehova Nyasaye kod tekone, e kindeno mano thinyre mondo oyieng piny.
023	ISA	002	022	We keto genoni kuom dhano nimar dhano, en mana muya kende mawuok e ume. Koso en angʼo man kuome maber?
023	ISA	003	001	Neuru koro Ruoth Nyasaye, ma en Jehova Nyasaye Maratego, biro tieko mich kod kony mikelo ne Jerusalem kod Juda. Notiek kit chiemo duto kod pi
023	ISA	003	002	thuondi maroteke kod jolweny, gi jongʼad bura gi jonabi gi jokor wach kod jodongo,
023	ISA	003	003	jatend lweny morito ji piero abich gi joma ogen, jongʼad rieko, jopecho molony kod joma olony e wach.
023	ISA	003	004	Anaket mana yawuowi obed jotendgi, to rawere matindo noritgi.
023	ISA	003	005	Ji nosandre kendgi giwegi, ka ngʼato sando mana wadgi owuon bende jogo modak mokiewo nosandre kendgi giwegi. Jomatindo notug lweny gi jomadongo, kendo ji ajiya nocha joma ogen.
023	ISA	003	006	Ngʼato nochun achiel kuom owetene manie dala wuon-gi kowacho niya, “In ema in-gi lep loch, koro telnwa; kendo ibed gi teko ewi pinywa mokethoreni.”
023	ISA	003	007	To e kindeno ngʼatno nodwoki niya, “Ooyo ok dabed ruodhu, nimar aonge gi chiemo kata lewni e oda madimi uketa abed jatend ogandani.”
023	ISA	003	008	Jerusalem yiengni, bende Juda mukore; wechegi kod timbegi opogore gi dwach Jehova Nyasaye, nimar ok omi duongʼne nenre e diergi.
023	ISA	003	009	Wangʼ-gi nyiso ni gin joricho kendo richogi oyangore e lela mana ka richo mane ni Sodom, bende gionge gi wichkuot. Yaye, mano kaka ginine malit nikech gisekelo masira kuomgi giwegi.
023	ISA	003	010	Kone joma kare ni gin johawi, nimar giniyud pok kuom tichgi matek.
023	ISA	003	011	Yaye, mano kaka nobed malit ne joricho nikech masira nobed kuomgi. Enokumgi kuom gik maricho ma lwetgi osetimo.
023	ISA	003	012	Jomatindo ema thiro joga kendo mon ema jotendgi. Yaye joga, jotendu osewuondou, momiyo ubaro uweyo yo.
023	ISA	003	013	Jehova Nyasaye osebedo e kom bura mondo ongʼad bura ne oganda.
023	ISA	003	014	Sa ngʼado bura mar Jehova Nyasaye kuom jodongo kod jotend joge osechopo, kowacho niya, “Un ema useketho puotha mar mzabibu kendo gik ma uyako kukawo e ut joma odhier opongʼo uteu.
023	ISA	003	015	En angʼo momiyo usando kendo uthiro joga modhier?” Ruoth Nyasaye, ma en Jehova Nyasaye Maratego ema owacho.
023	ISA	003	016	Jehova Nyasaye wacho niya, “Mond Sayun sungore kendo kawore, gingʼayo ngʼutgi malo, kendo giningʼo wengegi. Bende giwuotho ka gingʼadore, ka gara manie tiendgi ywak.
023	ISA	003	017	Kuom mano Ruoth Nyasaye biro kelo adhonde ewi mond Sayun, kendo Jehova Nyasaye nomi timbegi mamono nenre ratiro.”
023	ISA	003	018	Odiechiengʼno Ruoth Nyasaye biro mayogi gik ma gilichorego kaka: bangli gi kitembini mag wich kod tigo mag ngʼut,
023	ISA	003	019	gi tigo miliero e it gi bangli mag lwetgi kod kitamba miliero e ngʼut,
023	ISA	003	020	gi kitembini mag wich, gi thiwni mag ofunj tielo, gi misip gi chupni motingʼo gik mangʼwe ngʼar kod ris,
023	ISA	003	021	gi tere mag lwedo gi mag um,
023	ISA	003	022	lewni mayom gi kode gi mifuke mag lwedo,
023	ISA	003	023	kod kio, gi lewni mabeyo gi lewni miliero e ngʼut kod mago miumogo wangʼ.
023	ISA	003	024	Kar winjo tik mangʼwe ngʼar to unuwinj mana tik madungʼ marach; kar bedo gi okanda to tol ema nutwerugo; kar bedo gi yie wich molos maber to bondo ema unudongʼ-go; kar bedo gi lewni mabeyo to unurwak mana pien gugru, kar bedo gi wangʼ man-gi chia to adhonde nopongʼ dendu.
023	ISA	003	025	Chwou notiek gi ligangla kendo jolweny magu norum e lweny.
023	ISA	003	026	Nduru gi ywak mag dengo nopongʼ dhorongeye mag Sayun, kendo dalano nodongʼ nono kokethore.
023	ISA	004	001	E kindeno mon abiriyo biro laro dichwo achiel, kagiwacho niya, “Wanacham chiembwa wawegi kendo wanarwak lepwa wawegi, makmana yienwa mondo oluongwa gi nyingi mondo igolnwa wichkuot!”
023	ISA	004	002	E kindeno Bad Yath mar Jehova Nyasaye nobed maber kendo man-gi duongʼ, kendo olemo mar piny nobed mor kod duongʼ ne jo-Israel motony.
023	ISA	004	003	Eka joma noyud kotony e Sayun kod Jerusalem noluong ni jomaler, ma gin kar romb ji duto moyud kangima e Jerusalem
023	ISA	004	004	Ruoth Nyasaye noluok richo mag mond Sayun; kendo enopwodh remo manochwer Jerusalem gi roho mar ngʼado bura kod roho mar mach.
023	ISA	004	005	Bangʼe Jehova Nyasaye nokel rumbi mar iro ne ji godiechiengʼ kendo ligek mach mangʼangʼni gotieno e Got Sayun. Duongʼni nobed ka yath maduongʼ makelo tipo.
023	ISA	004	006	Nobed mana ka tado makelo tipo ka chiengʼ rieny kendo ka kama ji ringo tonyie ka bwok ne koth kod ahiti maduongʼ.
023	ISA	005	001	Abiro wero wend ngʼat ma ahero, wer mar puothe mar mzabibu niya: Jal ma ahero ne nigi puoth mzabibu e bath got kama omewo.
023	ISA	005	002	Ne opure maber mogolo kite duto manie iye kendo opidhoe olembe mabeyo ahinya moyier. Ne ogero kama otingʼore gi malo mar ngʼicho e chuny puodhono bende noloso kama ibiyoe mzabibu. Eka nomanyo olembe mabeyo to kata kamano neginyago mana olembe maricho.
023	ISA	005	003	“Koro un joma odak Jerusalem to gi jogo modak Juda; ngʼadieuru bura e kinda kod puotha mar mzabibu.
023	ISA	005	004	Angʼo machielo mane onego otim e puotha mar mzabibu maloyo mano mane atimone? Kane adwaro olembe mabeyo to angʼo mane omiyo onyago mana mago maricho?
023	ISA	005	005	Koro abiro nyisou gima abiro timo ne puotha mar mzabibu: Abiro golo chiende oko, kendo ibiro kethe, abiro muko ohingane kendo nonyone piny.
023	ISA	005	006	Bende anaweye kojwangʼore ma ok olose kata doye kendo ongʼono, kod kuthe ema nodongie. Abiro chiko boche polo mondo kik koth ochwene.”
023	ISA	005	007	Puoth mzabibu mar Jehova Nyasaye Maratego en od jo-Israel, kod jo-Juda e puodho mamiye mor. Osedwaro mondo ngʼado bura makare obedie, to oneno mana nek kendo osedwaro mondo one tim makare, to owinjo mana ywak mar lit.
023	ISA	005	008	Unune malit, un joma mayo ji utegi ma gisegero kendo umayo ji puothegi, maonge kama odongʼ ma udongʼ ka udak kendu e pinyno.
023	ISA	005	009	Jehova Nyasaye Maratego osewacho ayanga ka awinjo ni: “Kata kamano ute madongo biro dongʼ gunda, kendo ute madongo moger mabeyo biro dongʼ maonge joma odakie.
023	ISA	005	010	Heka apar mar mzabibu nogol mana olemo karaya achiel kende, kendo kodhi moromo gorogoro nonyag cham maromo debe kende.”
023	ISA	005	011	Unune malit un joma chiewo gokinyi kulawo kuonde kongʼo, un ma ubudho kuneno nyaka chuny otieno ka umer maonge rieko.
023	ISA	005	012	Gitimo nyasigi gi kongʼo, gi nyatiti, gi orutu, gi oyieke kod asili, to ok gidewo gik ma Jehova Nyasaye osetimo bende ok giluoro tij lwete.
023	ISA	005	013	Omiyo koro joga biro dhi e twech nikech bedo maonge winjo; jotendgi kech biro nego, Kendo oganda modongʼ to riyo ema biro nego.
023	ISA	005	014	Kuom mano piny joma otho ongʼamo dhoge malach ka dande oyawore malich; kendo enomuony jotelo kod oganda mamoko e kinde ma gikokee gi mor.
023	ISA	005	015	Omiyo dhano nodwok piny kendo ogendini duto nogol tekogi, kendo timbe jonjore notieki.
023	ISA	005	016	To Jehova Nyasaye Maratego notingʼ malo gi timne makare, kendo Nyasaye maler nonyis lerne gi timne makare.
023	ISA	005	017	Eka rombe nokwa e legegi giwegi; to nyirombe nokwa e gundni mane mag jomoko.
023	ISA	005	018	Unune malit un joma osiko katimo richo ka umede gi miriambo, kod timbe anjawo,
023	ISA	005	019	kod joma wacho ni joga niya, “Nyasaye mondo oreti, kendo otim gima odwaro timo, mondo wanene. We gima Jal Maler mar Israel dwaro timo otimre mondo wangʼeye.”
023	ISA	005	020	Mano kaka nobed malit ne joma luongo tim mamono ni ber to tim maber ni rach; jogo maketo mudho kar ler to kar ler gikete mudho, joma keto gik makech kar mamit to mamit giketo kar makech.
023	ISA	005	021	Mano kaka nobed malit ne jogo mariek e wengegi giwegi kendo kwano ni ongʼeyo gik moko duto.
023	ISA	005	022	Mano kaka nobed malit ne thuondi mag madho kongʼo kendo molony e ruwo kongʼo makech.
023	ISA	005	023	Un ma uweyo joketho nikech asoya, to joma onge ketho ema utamo e adiera margi.
023	ISA	005	024	Kuom mano kaka lew mach wangʼo yugi kendo kaka lum motwo lal nono e mach, e kaka tiendgi notow bende maua mawuok e itgi nolwar mana ka buru, nikech gisedagi chik mar Jehova Nyasaye Maratego kendo chayo wach Jal Maler mar Israel.
023	ISA	005	025	Kuom mano Jehova Nyasaye osekecho gi joge; kendo oserieyo bade kuomgi monegogi. Gode yiengni kendo ringre joma otho odhurore e wangʼ yore ka yugi. To kata bed ni magi duto osetimore, to mirimbe pod ok okwe, nimar pod okecho kodgi.
023	ISA	005	026	Otingʼo bandera malo ne ogendini moa mabor, kendo ogoyo tungʼ koluongo jogo moa e tunge piny. Gibiro mapiyo piyo ka giringo matek.
023	ISA	005	027	Onge kata mana ngʼato achiel kuomgi ma ol kata machwanyore, bende onge kata ngʼato achiel kuomgi ma nindo tero, bende onge moro ma okanda ombekni e nungone kata ma tond wuochene ochot.
023	ISA	005	028	Asernigi bith bende atungegi duto oywa motegno, kendo faresegi ombongʼ tiendgi ojingʼ, tiend gechegi winyore ka kalausi.
023	ISA	005	029	Giruto ka sibuor kendo gingʼur ka sibuoche matindo, bende gimor ka gidwaro mako le, mi gitingʼ-gi e dhogi maonge ngʼama nyalo resogi.
023	ISA	005	030	Odiechiengno ginirut kuome mana ka mor mar ataro. Kendo ka ngʼato ongʼiyo pinyno to none mudho gi kuyo; kata mana ler mar chiengʼ boche polo noum.
023	ISA	006	001	E higano mane Ruoth Uzia othoe, naneno Ruoth Nyasaye kobet e kom duongʼ motingʼore malo kendo omi luor, ka tiend lawe opongʼo hekalu.
023	ISA	006	002	E wiye malo malaike miluongoni serafi ochungʼe kamoro ka moro nigi bwombe auchiel ka bwombe ariyo giumogo wengegi, to bwombe ariyo mamako giumogo tiendegi, to bwombe ariyo modongʼ gihuyogo.
023	ISA	006	003	Negiluongore moro ka moro kagiwacho ni: “Maler, Maler, Maler en Jehova Nyasaye Maratego; piny duto opongʼ gi duongʼne.”
023	ISA	006	004	E seche mane dwondgi kok kamano, mise mag dhoudi ne yiengni kendo hekalu ne opongʼ kod iro.
023	ISA	006	005	Ne aywak niya, “mano kaka lit! Arumo chuth! Nimar an ngʼat ma dhoge wacho gik ma ok ler kendo adak e kind joma wechegi ochido, eka an to aseneno Ruoth, ma en Jehova Nyasaye Maratego gi wangʼa awuon.”
023	ISA	006	006	Eka achiel kuom malaike miluongo ni serafi nohuyo mochopo buta kotingʼo mach e lwete, mosegolo gi ramaki e kendo mar misango.
023	ISA	006	007	Nokawo gino momulogo dhoga mi owacho niya, “Ne, koro asemulo lewi, mi kethoni oseweni kendo richoni osepwodhi.”
023	ISA	006	008	Eka ne awinjo dwond Ruoth Nyasaye kapenjo niya, “Ere ngʼama abiro oro? Koso en ngʼa monego odhinwa?” Kendo ne adwoko niya, “Eri antie, ora!”
023	ISA	006	009	Eka nowacho niya, “Dhiyo kendo iwachne jogi kama: “‘Ubiro siko kuwinjo weche miwacho to wach ok nodonjnu ngangʼ; ubiro siko kungʼicho, to ok unune gimoro.’
023	ISA	006	010	Ket chuny jogi obed modhil, kendo mi itgi dinre ma ok winj wach, bende wengegi obed ma ok nen. Nono to dipo ka wengegi oneno, kendo itgi owinjo wach, kendo mi chunygi ofwenyo tiend weche, mi gilokre ma chang-gi.”
023	ISA	006	011	Eka napenjo niya, “Yaye Ruoth Nyasaye, mano notimre nyaka karangʼo?” Kendo nodwoko niya, “Nyaka chop mier madongo ruombre piny madongʼ gunda maonge joma odakie, bende mi udi ma ji odakie ojwangʼ kendo puothe duto kethre mi jwangʼ-gi,
