# BOOK	029	JOE	Joel	Joel
029	JOE	001	001	Wach Jehova Nyasaye mane obiro ne Joel wuod Pethuel.
029	JOE	001	002	Winjuru ma, un jodongo; chikuru itu, un duto ma udak e piny. Bende gima chalo kama osetimore e ndalou, kata e ndalo mag kwereu?
