041	MAR	001	004	Kuom mano, Johana nowuok e thim koyalo ni mondo ji oyud batiso kaka ranyisi ni giselokore gidwogo ir Nyasaye kendo oweyonegi richogi.
041	MAR	001	005	Kuom mano, jopiny Judea duto kod ji duto moa Jerusalem nowuok odhi ire. Ne gihulo richogi mi Johana nobatisogi e Aora Jordan.
041	MAR	001	006	Johana norwakore gi lewni molos gi yie ngamia kendo notweyo kamba mar pien e nungone. Nochamo bonyo kod mor kich manie thim.
041	MAR	001	007	Wach mane Johana yalo ne chal kama: “Ngʼat moro biro bangʼa ma oloya gi duongʼ, ok awinjora gonyo kata tond wuochene.
041	MAR	001	008	An abatisou gi pi, to en obiro batisou gi Roho Maler.”
041	MAR	001	009	E kindeno Yesu nobiro koa Nazareth, e piny Galili mi Johana nobatise e aora Jordan.
