041	MAR	014	060	Eka jadolo maduongʼ nochungʼ malo e nyimgi mopenjo Yesu niya, “Dak idwok wachno? Ma wach manade ma jogi wacho kuomini?”
041	MAR	014	061	To Yesu nolingʼ alingʼa thi ma ok odwoke. Jadolo maduongʼ nochako openje niya, “In e Kristo ma Wuod Nyasaye Mangima koso?”
041	MAR	014	062	Yesu nodwoke niya, “Ee, An. To unune Wuod Dhano kobet e bat korachwich mar Jal Maratego kendo kolor oa e boche polo.”
041	MAR	014	063	Jadolo maduongʼ noyiecho lepe kowacho niya, “Pod wadwaro joneno mamoko nangʼo?
041	MAR	014	064	Un uwegi usewinjo koyanyo Nyasaye. Uparo nade?” Giduto ne gikwede kaka ngʼat mowinjore githo.
041	MAR	014	065	Eka jomoko nochako ngʼulo olawo kuome. Negitweyo wangʼe mi gigoye ngum, kagiwacho niya, “Hul ane ngʼa mogoyi.” Askeche to nongʼwane ka girodhe.
041	MAR	014	066	Kane oyudo Petro obet oko e laru, achiel kuom nyiri matiyone jadolo maduongʼ nobiro machiegni.
041	MAR	014	067	Ka noneno Petro kaoyo mach, nodhi machiegni kode morange matut, bangʼe owachone niya, “In bende ne in gi ja-Nazareth miluongo ni Yesu.”
041	MAR	014	068	To Petro nokwere kawacho niya, “Ok angʼeyo kendo kata winjo ok awinj tiend gima iwachono.” Bangʼe noa kanyo odhi e dhorangach.
041	MAR	014	069	Ka nyako ma jatichno nochako onene e dhorangach, nochako owacho ne joma ochungʼ kanyo niya, “Ngʼatni en achiel kuomgi.”
041	MAR	014	070	To Petro nochako okwer kendo. Bangʼ kinde matin joma nochungʼ machiegni nowacho ne Petro niya, “adier in achiel kuomgi, nimar in ja-Galili.”
041	MAR	014	071	To en nochako kwongʼore mowachonegi koramo niya, “Ok angʼeyo ngʼat muwuoyo kuomeno.”
041	MAR	014	072	Gikanyono thuon gweno nokok kendo mar ariyo. Eka Petro noparo wach mane oyudo Yesu osewachone niya, “Kapok thuon gweno okok nyadiriyo to wangʼ inikweda nyadidek.” Wachno nobedone malit mi nochako ywak.
041	MAR	015	001	Gokinyi mangʼich, jodolo madongo gi jodong oganda gi jopuonj Chik, kaachiel gi jobuch Sanhedrin ne joriwo paro kuom gima nowinjore gitim. Negitweyo Yesu mi gitere e nyim Pilato.
041	MAR	015	002	Pilato nopenjo Yesu niya, “In e ruodh jo-Yahudi?” To Yesu nodwoke niya, “Ee, en kaka iwachono.”
041	MAR	015	003	Jodolo madongo nodonjone gi weche mathoth.
041	MAR	015	004	Omiyo Pilato nochako openje niya, “Dwokawa, donge ineno kaka gidonjoni gi ketho mangʼeny?”
041	MAR	015	005	To Yesu nolingʼ alingʼa kendo ma ok odwoke, mi Pilato nohum nono.
