041	MAR	015	028	Mano nochopo ndiko ma nondiki chon niya, “Nokwane e oganda joma richo.”]
041	MAR	015	029	Joma ne kadho kanyo nojare ka giyanye ka gikino wiyegi kendo giwacho niya, “Oo! In manyocha iwacho ni inyalo ketho hekalu mi ichak igere bangʼ ndalo adekni,
041	MAR	015	030	wuog ane e msalaba ilor piny kendo iresri kendi ane!”
