043	JOH	001	026	Johana nodwokogi niya, “An abatisou gi pi, to nitie ngʼato e dieru ma ukia.
043	JOH	001	027	En Jal mabiro bangʼa, ma ok awinjora gonyo tond wuochene.”
043	JOH	001	028	Magi duto notimore Bethania, loka mar aora Jordan, kuma Johana ne batisoe ji.
043	JOH	001	029	Kinyne Johana noneno Yesu kabiro ire, mi nowacho niya, “Neuru, Jalcha e Nyarombo mar Nyasaye, magolo richo mar piny!
043	JOH	001	030	Ma e jal mane awuoyo kuome kane awacho ni, ‘Ngʼato mabiro bangʼa oloya mabor, nikech ne entie kapok ne abetie.’
