043	JOH	020	024	Thoma (ma bende iluongo ni Didimas), ma en achiel kuom jopuonjre apar gariyo, ne ok ni kodgi e kinde mane Yesu ofwenyorenigi.
043	JOH	020	025	Omiyo jopuonjre mamoko nokone niya, “Waseneno Ruoth!” To nowachonegi niya, “An to ka ok aneno lwete kuonde mane musmal ochwowo, mi aketo lith lweta kuondego, kendo asoyo lweta e ngʼetne, to ok abi yie wachno.”
043	JOH	020	026	Bangʼ juma achiel, jopuonjre ne ni ei ot kendo, to chiengʼno Thoma ne ni kodgi. Kata obedo ni dhoudi nolor, Yesu nobiro mochungʼ e diergi momosogi niya, “Okweuru!”
043	JOH	020	027	Eka nowachone Thoma niya, “Ket lith lweti kae kendo nee lwetena. Chor lweti kuoma bangʼe iketi e ngʼetna. We bedo ngʼama riwo gi kiawa, bed ngʼama nigi yie!”
043	JOH	020	028	Thoma nodwoke niya, “Ruodha kendo Nyasacha!”
043	JOH	020	029	Eka Yesu nowachone niya, “In iyie nikech isenena, to ogwedh joma pok onena, to oseyie.”
043	JOH	020	030	Yesu notimo ranyisi gi honni mamoko mangʼeny, ka jopuonjrene neno, ma ok ondiki e kitabuni.
043	JOH	020	031	To magi ondiki mondo uyie ni Yesu e Kristo ma Wuod Nyasaye, kendo mondo ka uyie kamano, to ubed gi ngima e nyinge.
043	JOH	021	001	Bangʼ ka gigo nosetimore, Yesu nochako onenore kendo ni jopuonjrene e dho Nam Tiberia. To nenruokne kodgi nobet kama:
043	JOH	021	002	Simon Petro, Thoma (ma bende iluongo ni Didimas), Nathaniel mane aa Kana e piny Galili, yawuot Zebedi, kod jopuonjre mamoko ariyo, noyudo ochokore kanyakla.
043	JOH	021	003	Simon Petro nowachonegi niya, “Adok lupo” kendo negiwachone niya, “Wan bende wadok kodi.” Omiyo negiwuok gidhi kendo negidonjo ei yie. To otienono duto onge gima negimako.
043	JOH	021	004	Kinyne kogwen, Yesu nochungʼ e dho nam, to jopuonjre ne ok ongʼeye.
043	JOH	021	005	Noluongogi niya, “Jowadwa, bende unie gi rech moro?” Negidwoke niya, “Ooyo.”
043	JOH	021	006	Nowachonegi niya, “Boluru gogo mau yo bat korachwich mar yie, to ubiro mako rech.” Kane gitimo kamano, ywayo gogo nyaka ei yie notamogi, nikech rech ne ngʼeny mohewogi ywayo.
043	JOH	021	007	Eka japuonjre ma Yesu nohero nowacho ni Petro niya, “En Ruoth!” Sa nogono ma Simon Petro nowinje kowacho niya, “En Ruoth,” notweyo lawe mar abola e nungone, nimar noyudo osegole oko mi nochikore ei pi.
043	JOH	021	008	Jopuonjre mamoko to ne luwo bangʼe ka gin ei yie, kendo ka giywayo gogo ma rech opongʼo, nimar ne koro ok gin mabor gi dho nam, kendo nodongʼnegi mana fut mia ariyo gi piero ochiko gabich kende to gichop oko.
043	JOH	021	009	Kane gigowo e dho nam, negineno mach maliel ka ni kanyo ka oket rech e wiye, kod makati moko.
043	JOH	021	010	Yesu nowachonegi niya, “Keluru rech moko kuom mago ma usemako.”
043	JOH	021	011	Simon Petro nodonjo ei pi, mi noywayo gogo nyaka dho wath. Nopongʼ gi rech madongo dongo ma dirom rech mia achiel gi piero abich gadek, to kata negingʼeny kamano, to gogo ne ok oyiech.
043	JOH	021	012	Yesu nowachonegi niya, “Suduru machiegni uchiem.” Onge japuonjre kata achiel mane ohedhore penje niya, “In ngʼa?” Negingʼeyo ni en Ruoth.
043	JOH	021	013	Yesu nobiro mokawo makati omiyogi, kendo rech bende nomiyogi kamano.
043	JOH	021	014	Mano ne en fwenyruok mar Yesu mar adek ni jopuonjrene bangʼ chier aa kuom joma otho.
043	JOH	021	015	Kane gisetieko chiemo, Yesu nopenjo Simon Petro niya, “Simon wuod Johana, bende ihera adier moloyo jogi?” Nodwoke niya, “Ee, Ruoth, ingʼeyo ni aheri.” Yesu nowachone niya, “Kare pidh nyiromba.”
043	JOH	021	016	Nochako openje kendo mar ariyo niya, “Simon wuod Johana, bende ihera adier?” Nodwoke niya, “Ee, Ruoth, ingʼeyo ni aheri.” Yesu nowachone niya, “Kare rit romba.”
043	JOH	021	017	Nopenje mar adek niya, “Simon wuod Johana, bende ihera?” Petro nokuyo nikech Yesu nopenje mar adek niya, “Bende ihera?” Nodwoke niya, “Ruoth, in ingʼeyo gik moko duto; ingʼeyo ni aheri.” Yesu nowachone niya, “Kare pidh romba.
043	JOH	021	018	Adier, adier awachoni, kane pod itin, to nirwakori kendi kendo ne inyalo dhi kamoro amora mihero; to kibiro doko moti, to ibiro rieyo bedeni ne ngʼama chielo ma biro rwakoni lepi mi teri kuma ok idwar dhiye.”
043	JOH	021	019	Yesu nowacho mano mondo onyisgo kit tho ma Petro ne biro miyogo Nyasaye duongʼ. Eka nowachone niya, “Luwa!”
043	JOH	021	020	Petro nolokore moneno japuonjre mane Yesu ohero kaluwogi. (Ma e ngʼat mane otenore kuom Yesu kane gilworo mesa gichamo chiemb odhiambo, mi openje niya, “Ruoth, en ngʼa madwaro ndhogi?”)
043	JOH	021	021	Kane Petro onene, nopenjo niya, “Ruoth, to en to?”
043	JOH	021	022	Yesu nodwoke niya, “Ka adwaro ni osik kongima nyaka aduogi, to mano chandi nangʼo? In to luwa!”
043	JOH	021	023	Dwoko mane Yesu odwokono nomiyo wachno olandore e kind jowete ni japuonjreno ok bi tho ngangʼ, to Yesu to nowacho mana niya, “Ka adwaro ni osik kongima nyaka aduogi, to mano chandi nangʼo?”
043	JOH	021	024	Ma e japuonjre makoro timo neno kuom gigi kendo en bende ema nondikogi piny. Wangʼeyo ni nende en adier.
043	JOH	021	025	Yesu notimo gik mangʼeny mamoko. Ka dine ndikgi duto moro ka moro kuomgi, to an gi ratiro ni kata mana piny ngima ok doromo kano kitepe duto ma dine ondiki.
