048	GAL	003	018	Nimar ka Nyasaye miyowa girkeni mana kuom mako Chik, to mano nyiso ni ok wayudgi kuom singruok. To Nyasaye, kuom ngʼwonone, nochiwo gwethne ni Ibrahim kuom singruok.
048	GAL	003	019	To koro ere tij Chik? Chik nomedi mondo onyis dhano kaka en jaketho, nyaka chop kinde ma nyakwar Ibrahim mane osingi nobi. Malaika nokelo Chik moketo e lwet jathek.
048	GAL	003	020	To jathek ok chungʼ kar ngʼat achiel; to Nyasaye to en achiel.
